        ],
        "source_type": "text",
        "source_sentence": "The degree of functionalization for the isolated copolymer PSBPhQ-H-co-PSSiMe was calculated to be 10.5% according to <sup>1</sup>H NMR integration and 12.8% according to GPC-MALLS, which is very close to the feed ratio of BBr<sub>3</sub> to $\\mathrm { S i M e } _ { 3 }$functional groups.<sup>30</sup> The absorption and emission spectra of PSBPhQ-H-co-PSSiMe<sub>3</sub> are virtually identical to those of PSBPhQ-H (Figure 4), and the quantum efficiency of 0.18 for PSBPhQ-H-co-PSSiMe<sub>3</sub> matches very well with that of 0.17 determined for PSBPhQ-H."
      },
